#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:5
#: 7547050d1d7f483fb910203fcb4e77a6
msgid "X-Plane Hardware in the Loop Simulation"
msgstr "X-Plane 硬件在环仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:7
#: b3da182f5fa74b788ff8d8f8bacc5020
msgid "Archived, no longer supported"
msgstr "已存档，不再受支持"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:9
#: 0c39cd09f40142cd8025b611dc115106
msgid ""
"This article explains how to set up *X-Plane Hardware in the Loop "
"Simulation*."
msgstr "本文介绍如何设置 *X-Plane 硬件在环仿真*。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:14
#: afc8a049cf324b9ead37c78f5c9a44d6
msgid "This simulator is Plane specific."
msgstr "此仿真器仅适用于 Plane（固定翼）。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:17
#: 9019428937f64d9b93e1f00842d94597
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:19
#: a8c397d845944033a55aa5da247cdc9e
msgid ""
"The Simulation tab is visible on the top icon row when “Advanced View” is "
"checked in the Config tab."
msgstr "在 Config 选项卡中勾选「Advanced View」后，顶部图标行会显示 Simulation 选项卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:26
#: 15e0617a1255451ea9277dc0af24be7f
msgid "How to set up a full hardware-in-the-loop simulation with X-Plane"
msgstr "如何使用 X-Plane 搭建完整的硬件在环仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:31
#: 2a8c7d6490d94ce58254501e310676c9
msgid ""
"It's easy to create a powerful \"hardware in the loop\" simulator with APM, "
"with a Flight Simulator \"fooling\" APM with sensor and GPS data like it "
"would experience in flight, and then APM flying the plane accordingly."
msgstr ""
"使用 APM 搭建强大的「硬件在环」仿真器非常简单，飞行仿真器像真实飞行一样向 APM 提供传感器和 GPS 数据，然后 APM 据此驾驶飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:36
#: 1d5c485702cf4487afd0a3376f571b9e
msgid "The overall setup looks like this:"
msgstr "整体设置如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:42
#: f23e53fc634d48a08976442e551663c0
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:44
#: fd355d35df7f41b987a5b83e57c486cd
msgid ""
"Download the `X-Plane 10 flight simulator "
"<http://www.x-plane.com/desktop/home/>`__, if you don't already have it. The"
" demo is free but times out after ten minutes. It's well worth `buying the "
"full version <http://www.x-plane.com/store/landing/>`__, which is just "
"$29.99. We support the 10.x versions."
msgstr ""
"如果还没有，请下载 `X-Plane 10 飞行仿真器 "
"<http://www.x-plane.com/desktop/home/>`__。演示版免费但十分钟后超时。非常值得 `购买完整版 "
"<http://www.x-plane.com/store/landing/>`__，售价仅 $29.99。我们支持 10.x 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:48
#: 3c73249732c54a4598218405d59b02c5
msgid ""
"Load the HIL Simulations version of the APM software with the Mission "
"Planner (circled in red below; pick the one for the aircraft you want to "
"simulate)."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 加载 HIL 仿真版本的 APM 软件（下方红圈标注；选择您要仿真的飞机对应的版本）。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:51
#: 06214380a7884995aeefc44d85b4d552
msgid ""
"If you haven't done a setup already, press \"APM Setup\" on the Mission "
"Planner Firmware page, which opens another dialog. Follow the instructions "
"on the \"Reset\", \"Radio Input\" and \"Mode\" tabs of the dialog. Then "
"you're ready to sim!"
msgstr ""
"如果尚未进行设置，请在 Mission Planner 固件页面点击「APM "
"Setup」，这将打开另一个对话框。按照对话框中「Reset」、「Radio Input」和「Mode」选项卡上的说明操作。然后您就可以开始仿真了！"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:60
#: a2122fb7eebe4e6aa67911cda8d3ed9f
msgid "Connecting APM and X-Plane"
msgstr "连接 APM 和 X-Plane"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:62
#: 68f556d875f94d6884eca6a7a241524f
msgid ""
"The Mission Planner will serve as your bridge to X-plane and will send the "
"output from your APM's serial port connection to the flight simulator."
msgstr "Mission Planner 将作为 X-Plane 的桥梁，将 APM 串口连接的输出发送到飞行仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:66
#: c819d82bfade4241a8d68f2d91612255
msgid ""
"NOTE: If you're using a Mac, you can use a Perl-based solution (this also "
"works on Windows, if you prefer Perl). Here's what you need: `X-Plane.pl "
"<http://api.ning.com/files/xRNyASq2LjL3D2W7-D-4tvKSdm-2NifDygSAVsFxnngOUoIC4XkcPnGyPL-"
"zeJJRNrWyuifxCVSQnyMVibddCBg-OzRzLOQ9/XPlane.pl>`__"
msgstr ""
"注意：如果您使用 Mac，可以使用基于 Perl 的解决方案（如果您更喜欢 Perl，在 Windows "
"上也适用）。以下是您需要的：`X-Plane.pl "
"<http://api.ning.com/files/xRNyASq2LjL3D2W7-D-4tvKSdm-2NifDygSAVsFxnngOUoIC4XkcPnGyPL-"
"zeJJRNrWyuifxCVSQnyMVibddCBg-OzRzLOQ9/XPlane.pl>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:71
#: 1cdaebfc2fc442c9810d0e8dbef52b33
msgid "X-Plane Settings"
msgstr "X-Plane 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:73
#: 0b2926239f55439bad82208841fab532
msgid ""
"X-Plane communicates over a network interface to the Flight Planner. Because"
" of this you can run X-Plane and the Flight Planner on different computers. "
"This is helpful if X-Plane running on a slower computer. Frame rate is very "
"important."
msgstr ""
"X-Plane 通过网络接口与飞行规划器通信。因此您可以在不同的计算机上运行 X-Plane 和飞行规划器。如果 X-Plane "
"运行在较慢的计算机上，这会很有帮助。帧率非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:78
#: 225fe37a205c4dd8b78d5f7f7cc54595
msgid ""
"You can choose any aircraft in X-Plane, but the most realistic one for our "
"purposes is the PT-60 RC airplane. These are the screen shots that show the "
"necessary settings you need to set in the Settings Menu – Data Input and "
"Output:"
msgstr ""
"您可以在 X-Plane 中选择任何飞机，但对我们来说最接近实际的是 PT-60 遥控飞机。以下截图显示了您需要在「Settings」菜单—「Data "
"Input and Output」中设置的必要选项："

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:89
#: c1d68c0d1e9b4722a7367f603ddef862
msgid "You may also want to turn on the Frame Rate to display on the screen."
msgstr "您可能还想在屏幕上显示帧率。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:91
#: 4b9d1d0fce3f428a880ce0c52c74ba8b
msgid ""
"On the IP screen on Xplane, change the UDP data port to 49005 as shown "
"below. (The Mission Planner also has an advanced IP setting dialog, but "
"leave it at the default of 49000. 49005 is the UDP port coming in from "
"Xplane, 49000 is the UDP port going out from the Mission Planner.)"
msgstr ""
"在 X-Plane 的 IP 界面上，将 UDP 数据端口更改为 49005，如下图所示。（Mission Planner 也有一个高级 IP "
"设置对话框，但保持默认的 49000 即可。49005 是来自 X-Plane 的传入 UDP 端口，49000 是 Mission Planner "
"的传出 UDP 端口。）"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:99
#: 0d505c3a349249888a11e4957fec7969
msgid ""
"If you are running X-plane on the same computer as APM Mission Planner, then"
" enter the loopback IP address (127.0.0.1) as shown above. If you are "
"running X-plane on a different computer, enter the IP address of the other "
"computer here(for example 192.168.1.1)."
msgstr ""
"如果您在与 APM Mission Planner 相同的计算机上运行 X-Plane，请输入回环 IP "
"地址（127.0.0.1），如上所示。如果在不同的计算机上运行 X-Plane，请在此处输入另一台计算机的 IP 地址（例如 192.168.1.1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:105
#: 6f6fb8a2124c4a389c9b3728de32b509
msgid "Flight planner settings"
msgstr "飞行规划器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:107
#: b89fcec377eb40d191e8e589c9956931
msgid ""
"Now you're ready to run the simulation. Start the Mission Planner, selecting"
" the COM port APM is assigned to and 115200 baud as the speed. Click on the "
"Simulation tab and you will be taken to this screen:"
msgstr ""
"现在您可以运行仿真了。启动 Mission Planner，选择 APM 分配到的 COM 端口和 115200 波特率。点击 Simulation "
"选项卡，您将进入此界面："

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:114
#: 4df47b1721c04734bf65adcded45f8fd
msgid ""
"If you are using X-Plane 10.x, you must check the \"XPlane 10\" checkbox "
"shown here:"
msgstr "如果您使用 X-Plane 10.x，必须勾选此处显示的「XPlane 10」复选框："

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:120
#: f7f58833b6204efdae5e3e1fdc9f5019
msgid ""
"If you are running APM Mission Planner on the same computer as X-Plane, then"
" the default IP settings should be fine. But if you're in doubt, you can "
"check the \"Advanced IP Settings\". The IP address should be 127.0.0.1 and "
"the port should be 49000, as shown. If you are running X-plane on a "
"different computer, though, enter the IP address of the other computer here "
"(for example 192.168.1.2). The port should be 49000 in either case."
msgstr ""
"如果您在与 X-Plane 相同的计算机上运行 APM Mission Planner，则默认 IP "
"设置应该没问题。如有疑问，可以检查「Advanced IP Settings」。IP 地址应为 127.0.0.1，端口应为 "
"49000，如图所示。但如果在不同计算机上运行 X-Plane，请在此处输入另一台计算机的 IP 地址（例如 "
"192.168.1.2）。两种情况下端口均应为 49000。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:127
#: 07bc705c5d494a09997c0f523236bc02
msgid ""
"Once you've selected Sim Link Start/Stop, if APM is connected and Xplane is "
"running, you should see the Mission Planner Sim screen fill with data."
msgstr ""
"选择「Sim Link Start/Stop」后，如果 APM 已连接且 X-Plane 正在运行，您应该会看到 Mission Planner Sim"
" 界面填满数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:131
#: b638d8b6b72e42779a0b737fcb5dd2af
msgid ""
"Turn your transmitter on and check your link to your receiver. (Remember "
"that if you're using APM 1 you must plug an ESC and LiPo into the RC pins of"
" APM to power the RC receiver; this is not necessary on APM 2, where the "
"radio is powered by the USB). When you move the sticks you should see the "
"APM outputs change on the Flight Planner Simulator window."
msgstr ""
"打开遥控器并检查与接收机的连接。（请记住，如果您使用 APM 1，必须将 ESC 和 LiPo 电池插入 APM 的 RC 引脚为遥控接收机供电；在 "
"APM 2 上不需要这样做，因为遥控接收机由 USB 供电）。移动摇杆时，您应该看到飞行规划器仿真器窗口中的 APM 输出发生变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:138
#: 442c9f1ce78b421c8a383af6b2d3a729
msgid ""
"For first testing, set your three RC toggle switch modes to Manual, "
"Stabilize and RTL. You can do that via the Mission Planner's MAVLink setup. "
"Hit control-G in the Mission Planner once you're connect to go to the setup "
"screen, where you will find the Modes setup."
msgstr ""
"首次测试时，将三个遥控拨动开关模式设置为手动（Manual）、稳定（Stabilize）和返航（RTL）。您可以通过 Mission Planner 的"
" MAVLink 设置来完成。连接后在 Mission Planner 中按 Ctrl-G 进入设置界面，在那里您可以找到模式设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:144
#: da39a8621c5b4cd596889f1ba575c45c
msgid "Flight test"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:146
#: 50c059e1440c4ee8aecb55473a0f7052
msgid ""
"Now fly the plane in the sim with your RC transmitter. First, hit the \"C\" "
"key so you can see your plane up close and from the side. Try each stick on "
"your RC transmitter and make sure that the control surfaces go in the right "
"direction in manual mode. If they don't, reverse them at your RC transmitter"
" as you would with a normal RC airplane."
msgstr ""
"现在用遥控器在仿真中飞行飞机。首先，按「C」键从侧面近距离查看您的飞机。尝试遥控器上的每个摇杆，确认在手动模式下控制面朝正确方向偏转。如果不对，请像调整普通遥控飞机一样在遥控器上反转它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:152
#: 967c4b94d97b41c298186e14a34bd18c
msgid ""
"You can now try a flight. Reload the aircraft in Xplane, hit \"Shift-8\" so "
"you can see it from behind, and hit \"b\" to release the brakes. The "
"aircraft should begin moving forward. You can steer it on the ground with "
"your rudder stick. Once it's picked up speed, give it a little up elevator "
"to take off. You should be able to fly it like a RC flight simulator."
msgstr ""
"现在您可以尝试飞行。在 X-Plane "
"中重新加载飞机，按「Shift-8」从后方观察，按「b」释放刹车。飞机应开始向前移动。您可以用方向舵摇杆在地面上转向。一旦速度足够，轻推升降舵起飞。您应该能像"
" RC 飞行仿真器一样驾驶它。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:159
#: 6492c0d72b6f4e048cd9aee8acfcc2b6
msgid ""
"If it's flying well, try moving your toggle switch into stabilize mode. The "
"aircraft should immediately start flying flat and level. If it rolls upside "
"down and wants to fly that way, you'll need to reverse the ailerons on the "
"SIM model on your transmitter. Likewise for diving."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行良好，尝试将拨动开关切换到稳定模式。飞机应立即开始水平飞行。如果它翻转过来倒飞，您需要在遥控器上的仿真模型中反转副翼。俯冲也类似处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:164
#: e86e2e28075c4fd8a038417e77b95fec
msgid ""
"If stabilization works well, try RTL. The aircraft should return to the "
"start of the runway and circle there at 100m."
msgstr "如果稳定功能工作良好，尝试 RTL。飞机应返回跑道起点并在 100 米高度盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:167
#: b235a4c250cd47cabaf3e57bf4e2d309
msgid ""
"Once that is working, trying entering some waypoints and flying an auto "
"mission. In the Mission Planner read the stored waypoints and let it reset "
"home to the stored position (which will now be the airport in your Xplane "
"simulator that you're flying from). Click to add a few waypoints and switch "
"into auto to watch the show!"
msgstr ""
"完成后，尝试输入一些航点并执行自动任务。在 Mission Planner 中读取存储的航点，让其将归 home 重置为存储位置（现在是 X-Plane"
" 仿真器中您起飞的机场）。点击添加几个航点，切换到自动模式观看表演！"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:173
#: 6bfa65aa471744e58d100d82c209acfe
msgid ""
"In general, the correct order to load and run everything is as follows:"
msgstr "通常，正确加载和运行一切的顺序如下："

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:175
#: de3ffcd96dd14e3f8e85f0a2502ea710
msgid ""
"Use the Mission Planner to load the Simulator version of the APM code and "
"perform the setup."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 加载仿真器版本的 APM 代码并执行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:177
#: 57dc93a0741040b6aa5450ed904a3dfd
msgid ""
"Start Xplane. After it is initialized and while the plane is sitting on the "
"ground hit the \"a\" key for a rear view and then the \"p\" key to pause."
msgstr "启动 X-Plane。初始化后，飞机在地面静止时按「a」键查看后视图，然后按「p」键暂停。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:180
#: 6cb8b2a54e1f47d49eae037116b810f9
msgid ""
"Start the Mission Planner, select the right port and baud for your APM board"
" and connect to APM."
msgstr "启动 Mission Planner，为您的 APM 板选择正确的端口和波特率，并连接到 APM。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:182
#: 6918ca2b40da41e2b0bb936b6e211f99
msgid ""
"In the Mission Planner simulation tab, click the button in ArduPilotSim to "
"connect. You should see values appear in the output fields. Switch your TX "
"mode switch to the manual position and verify that the outputs are moving "
"with your TX sticks."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 仿真选项卡中，点击 ArduPilotSim "
"中的连接按钮。您应该看到输出字段中出现数值。将遥控器模式开关切换到手动位置，验证输出随遥控摇杆移动而变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:186
#: c96e9adb80c341d9afae845c0908f2ca
msgid "Make sure your throttle stick is down."
msgstr "确保油门摇杆在最低位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:187
#: 702cf6d89cd3411494ac5865cb22b143
msgid ""
"Switch to Xplane. You are ready to go. Click the \"p\" key to unpause. Hit "
"the \"b\" key to unlock the brakes. Advance the throttle and take off!"
msgstr "切换到 X-Plane。您已准备好出发。按「p」键解除暂停。按「b」键解锁刹车。推动油门起飞！"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:192
#: 0859f5b925cb4a289a50d7161a20fdb8
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:194
#: bde3563ef0544d2ea61d0e45a603b708
msgid ""
"I have been using the stock PT-60 in Xplane with good results. I would "
"recommend a cruise airspeed of 15 m/s"
msgstr "我一直使用 X-Plane 中的标准 PT-60 并取得了良好效果。建议巡航空速为 15 m/s"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:196
#: 2ef98d84ca85494295925aaa38592924
msgid ""
"One quirk of the PT-60 is that it bounces around a lot on the ground and if "
"you are not careful it has prop-strikes followed by simulated engine "
"failure, which is really annoying. If the engine has stopped, reload the "
"plane. Hold the pitch stick for a modest climb and go to full throttle."
msgstr ""
"PT-60 "
"的一个怪癖是它在地面上会大幅颠簸，如果不小心会发生螺旋桨打地，随后模拟引擎故障，这非常烦人。如果引擎停止，请重新加载飞机。保持俯仰摇杆适度爬升，推至全油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:201
#: 7aad3ec993fb4e9fb1fa0aba4217053e
msgid ""
"Remember that APM always sets its \"home\" location automatically at the "
"field, which in this case is whichever airport you've set Xplane to start "
"at. It will overwrite any home you may have set in the Mission Planner. If "
"you want the flight sim to start at a different airport, you must select "
"that from Xplane's \"Location\" menu. You can only select the provided "
"airports, not just any place in the world you want to fly."
msgstr ""
"请记住，APM 总是在飞行区自动设置「home」位置，在这种情况下是您在 X-Plane 中设置起飞的机场。它将覆盖您在 Mission Planner"
" 中可能设置的任何 home 位置。如果您想让飞行仿真器从不同的机场开始，必须从 X-Plane "
"的「Location」菜单中选择。您只能选择提供的机场，而不是世界上任何您想飞的地方。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:208
#: f37493aa839048be90335ef589559ad2
msgid "If you want to play with the code and load it via Arduino."
msgstr "如果您想修改代码并通过 Arduino 加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:210
#: fe4eeb527ce74b72a1402310e5c685f7
msgid ""
", rather than the pre-compiled hex file in the Mission Planner, you can. You"
" just need to change your APM_config.h file to the following:"
msgstr ""
"，而不是 Mission Planner 中的预编译 hex 文件，您可以这样做。只需将您的 APM_config.h 文件更改为以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:218
#: 5b75c30317cc45fa9d8373c2534ca9c3
msgid ""
"HIL_MODE_SENSORS is not currently (Jan 2012) working. HIL_MODE_ATTITUDE "
"informs Plane of the attitude of the plane but not the accelerations or roll"
" rates. HIL_MODE_SENSORS originally was going to inject the lower level "
"physics into the real sensor code, from which would (hopefully) be derived "
"the same or similar attitude figures, plus more information from the "
"Barometer and so on."
msgstr ""
"HIL_MODE_SENSORS 目前（2012 年 1 月）还不能工作。HIL_MODE_ATTITUDE 向 Plane "
"通报飞机的姿态，但不提供加速度或滚转角速度。HIL_MODE_SENSORS "
"最初计划将较低层次的物理数据注入真实的传感器代码，希望由此得到相同或相似的姿态数值，以及来自气压计等的更多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:225
#: 247410c6e41f4e02a026447018916805
msgid ""
"Software-in-the-loop (SITL) sim has taken this further, emulating !Arduino "
"registers and injecting the sensor information at the lowest level possible."
" It is therefore the better option if you want to sim with the most "
"realistic inputs."
msgstr ""
"软件在环（SITL）仿真在此基础上更进一步，模拟 Arduino "
"寄存器并在尽可能低的层次注入传感器信息。因此，如果您想以最真实的输入进行仿真，它是更好的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:231
#: 5b18f9662497434b8733bee12416eb84
msgid "Error messages and fixes"
msgstr "错误消息及修复方法"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:233
#: 8f9ee5ef25d54736b3b7faaef49f6a57
msgid ""
"Can't open serial port : The com port has not been selected or the port is "
"in use. Do you have a terminal open to the APM? Note that the mission "
"planner loads the connection window coms port menu with every port it finds."
" If the USB driver failed to hook up and did not promote a port into "
"!Windows, then this menu will be missing the actual port or may default to "
"another port."
msgstr ""
"无法打开串口：未选择 COM 端口或端口正在使用中。您是否打开了连接到 APM 的终端？请注意，Mission Planner 会在连接窗口的 COM "
"端口菜单中加载它找到的所有端口。如果 USB 驱动程序未能成功连接且未在 Windows 中提升端口，则此菜单可能缺少实际端口或默认为其他端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:239
#: c4c9210d55c348759525b5c8293507d9
msgid ""
"Socket (IP) setup problem. Do you have this open already? : You have another"
" program running that is using the IP Port and conflicting with the data "
"communications between Xplanes and APM Planner."
msgstr ""
"Socket（IP）设置问题。您是否已经打开了它？：您有另一个程序正在运行，它正在使用 IP 端口，与 X-Plane 和 APM Planner "
"之间的数据通信发生冲突。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:242
#: 5afddd9f31b043d6a39b27daa947994c
msgid ""
"Xplane Data Problem - You need DATA IN/OUT 3, 18, 19, 20 : Please redo the "
"setup and make sure all the boxes are ticked. You may need to restart "
"X-Plane."
msgstr ""
"X-Plane 数据问题——您需要 DATA IN/OUT 3、18、19、20：请重新进行设置并确保所有复选框都已勾选。您可能需要重启 "
"X-Plane。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:245
#: 7a268ae5db3f47a7b5b55aa965fd4ae6
msgid "Bad Gains!!! : One of the simulator gain numbers is invalid."
msgstr "增益错误！！！：某个仿真增益数值无效。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:246
#: fe6bc934f4544ac095fc8ebd34dbe5a4
msgid ""
"NO SIM data : ArduPilot Mega Planner is not receiving any data from Xplane. "
"Please check your Xplane settings."
msgstr "无仿真数据：ArduPilot Mega Planner 未收到来自 X-Plane 的任何数据。请检查您的 X-Plane 设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:248
#: 96b2a08b97a441cca35e394bd46911e7
msgid ""
"The radio has no control--you push the sticks and nothing happens. Are your "
"PID setting zero? Have you setup up your Radio inputs? The configuration "
"defaults may not be appropriate for your radio. Please review the minimum, "
"maximum and trim figures and if necessary use the radio Setup mode either "
"from the mission planner or from the command line setup mode."
msgstr ""
"遥控器无法控制——推摇杆没有任何反应。您的 PID "
"设置是否为零？您是否已设置好遥控器输入？配置默认值可能不适合您的遥控器。请检查最小值、最大值和微调数值，必要时从 Mission Planner "
"或命令行设置模式中使用遥控器设置模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:254
#: 5410bbcbcab441f7a6b30db464a8f7b5
msgid ""
"Flight controls are way off. You need to push the sticks way over to fly the"
" plane. Check your Radio setup in the APM. Did you configure the Radio? See "
"(7)."
msgstr "飞行控制严重偏差。您需要大幅推动摇杆才能操控飞机。请检查 APM 中的遥控器设置。您是否配置了遥控器？参见（7）。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:259
#: 3cc2ea810cde4382b108a77cb2ae22eb
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "调试"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:261
#: 984dea51ad464df882f524f91d44e39f
msgid ""
"The on-screen status details only update after a valid connection to the APM"
" has been made."
msgstr "屏幕上的状态详情只有在与 APM 成功连接后才会更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:263
#: f61962b461dc4627ad3664d852173145
msgid ""
"Open Terminal, and verify what you see. If the text is readable go to the "
"second point below, if it is not look at the first point"
msgstr "打开终端，验证所看到的内容。如果文本可读，请转到下面第二点；如果不可读，请查看第一点"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:266
#: 382974b963ae4dfdae9e022bd6aca5cc
msgid ""
"When you click Connect you should see the APM header printed in the text "
"box. If you don't you may not have the correct Comport or Baudrate"
msgstr "点击 Connect 时，您应该看到 APM 头信息打印在文本框中。如果没有，您可能选择了错误的 COM 端口或波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:269
#: 3b7ad5a4144341b5bf87d094a6270359
msgid ""
"Verify the setup by opening the Terminal in APM Planner and see what it "
"prints out. it should start with the APM header and continually spit out "
"AAA???? forever. If you don't see the AAA's then you may have uploaded the "
"wrong firmware (not simulation mode) or if you're loading the code manually,"
" not made the necessary changes to the **APM_Config.h** file."
msgstr ""
"通过打开 APM Planner 中的终端并查看其打印内容来验证设置。它应以 APM "
"头信息开头，并持续不断地输出「AAA????」。如果您看不到「AAA」，则可能上传了错误的固件（非仿真模式），或者如果是手动加载代码，则没有对 "
"**APM_Config.h** 文件进行必要的更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:276
#: 698e1833c5f041cd9b2497d95876edea
msgid ""
"Try re-doing the radio calibration after selecting the simulation, and make "
"sure the throttle gain is set to 10,000 in the simulation tab."
msgstr "尝试在选择仿真后重新进行遥控器校准，并确保仿真选项卡中的油门增益设置为 10,000。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:281
#: 981a253edd62425cbba1c024ea765099
msgid "Python Scripting with XPlane"
msgstr "Python 脚本与 X-Plane"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:283
#: 6eeceea77d3f4cdcb69fa1fc9be7c47f
msgid ""
"This section shows how to use Python for some basic scripted acrobatic moves"
" for fixed-wing airplanes (including a left roll, a right roll and most of a"
" loop). The instructions come from the tutorial `Scripted Fixed-Wing "
"Acrobatics <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/scripted-fixed-wing-"
"acrobatics>`__."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍如何使用 Python 为固定翼飞机编写一些基本的脚本特技动作（包括左滚、右滚和大部分筋斗）。说明来自教程 `脚本固定翼特技 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/scripted-fixed-wing-acrobatics>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:287
#: b3c7b91d70bb4a37859d5955ff17b9f8
msgid ""
"You need a python based script. You can start with the one I've put "
"together. It's attached here. \"`simple_script.txt "
"<http://api.ning.com/files/e86-46o09Aysi4zyyv8mnDWV0ljIXbNUV*fTsE9MwLsZ8J1em1bwUNnHadjWSmygB*jnKvZwo7Bx0A*AHE8pZVGLkN9W4n1u/simple_script.txt>`__\\"
" \""
msgstr ""
"您需要一个基于 Python 的脚本。您可以从我整理的这个开始，附件在此。\"`simple_script.txt "
"<http://api.ning.com/files/e86-46o09Aysi4zyyv8mnDWV0ljIXbNUV*fTsE9MwLsZ8J1em1bwUNnHadjWSmygB*jnKvZwo7Bx0A*AHE8pZVGLkN9W4n1u/simple_script.txt>`__\""

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:290
#: edb70c8f5d8442c7bac0c0c78acae04c
msgid ""
"With X-plane, the APM Mission Planner (MP) and the script open, get your "
"plane in the air and press \"p\" for pause. \"a\" will put you in chase view"
" (\"w\" to go back in the plane) and \"-\" and \"=\" will zoom your view of "
"the plane in and out."
msgstr ""
"打开 X-Plane、APM Mission "
"Planner（MP）和脚本后，将飞机升空并按「p」暂停。「a」进入追踪视角（「w」返回飞机内部视角），「-」和「=」缩放飞机视图。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:294
#: bffcb6b027b14dc1a174bd7891b42540
msgid ""
"In the MP click on the \"Flight Data\" button, then select the \"Actions\" "
"tab underneath the Heads-Up-Display."
msgstr "在 MP 中点击「Flight Data」按钮，然后选择平视显示器下方的「Actions」选项卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:296
#: c6771268efe04527a419f56153179900
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Script\" button. This will bring up another window with a "
"preloaded script (for Copter). Switch to the already open "
"\"simple_script.txt\" and select-all then copy."
msgstr ""
"点击「Script」按钮。这将弹出另一个窗口，其中预加载了一个脚本（针对 "
"Copter）。切换到已打开的「simple_script.txt」，全选然后复制。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:299
#: b908a260876c496ca3e471f2be3d21ff
msgid ""
"Go to the python script window and paste \"simple_script.txt\" in the python"
" script window. DO NOT close it yet."
msgstr "转到 Python 脚本窗口，将「simple_script.txt」粘贴到 Python 脚本窗口中。先不要关闭它。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:301
#: a7bbb23833a34ca59f537b4a12573f9d
msgid "Go to X-plane, and press \"p\" again to un-pause the plane."
msgstr "转到 X-Plane，再次按「p」解除暂停。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:302
#: d03601d165bb4687bf145fae64f48b23
msgid ""
"Go back to your python script window and close it. This will trigger the "
"execution of the script when you click \"yes\" in the pop-up."
msgstr "返回 Python 脚本窗口并关闭它。点击弹出框中的「yes」后将触发脚本执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/x-plane-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:304
#: 0e68690f905b49dea16e9ef8bcc05833
msgid "Watch your plane do some rolls, and most of a loop."
msgstr "观看您的飞机完成几个滚转和大部分筋斗动作。"
